>and the end of the freeze period is coming up.

My position is that the freeze continues until 5 years *after the three 
books have been published* (refgrammar, dictionary, and textbook), and that 
furthermore an end of the freeze will require the capability to discuss all 
change proposals only using Lojban.  So it is nowhere near coming up.

